<Rive version="1" kind="fragment">
    <!-- The story: a teaser of Vikram and Vetal, played by the Story state
         machine. Each chapter is a timeline keying the World node's inputs
         (the camera, the moon and wind, King Vikram, the golden wave), so it
         can be retimed in the editor. They play in turn and loop; the Story
         view model's triggers (toPeepal, toKing, toAstra) jump to one.
           Peepal   the camera circles the hero tree on amavas, fireflies
                    thick round it
           Vikram   down the path to King Vikram; round him as he walks to
                    the tree
           Astra    he stops and draws his bow; he looses: the string
                    ripples rings of gold, and a golden wave rolls through
                    the jungle, lighting it, the wind tearing at the trees -->
    <Artboard defaultStateMachineId="2:200" viewModelId="2:500" viewModelInstanceId="2:520" x="0" y="900" width="1280" height="720" styleId="2:2" name="Story" id="2:1">
